Package: carsonboot
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Carson <carson@example.invalid>
Description: Experimental x86_64 UEFI boot manager
 CarsonBoot is an experimental UEFI diagnostic application written in C
 and GNU Assembly. This package installs the EFI executable under
 /usr/lib/carsonboot. It does not modify an EFI System Partition or
 configure firmware boot entries.
